<view class="page">
  <custom-nav title="读懂孩子心测评" showBack="{{true}}" showHome="{{true}}"></custom-nav>

  <scroll-view class="page-scroll" scroll-y enhanced show-scrollbar="{{false}}">
    <view class="content">
      <view class="intro">
        <view class="intro-title">一张图读懂孩子心</view>
        <view class="intro-subtitle">相由心生，看图识人</view>
      </view>

      <view class="mind-brief">
        <view class="tag-row">
          <view class="tag-pill">相由心生</view>
          <view class="tag-pill">看图识人</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pain-card">
          <view class="pain-title">孩子为什么会这样？</view>
          <view class="pain-text">孩子为什么一说就哭？一遇到困难就退缩？一不顺心就发脾气？被人骂了只会生闷气？</view>
          <view class="pain-strong">家长，你需要读懂孩子的心了！</view>
        </view>
        <view class="method-card">
          <view class="method-title">只有读懂了孩子，才能因材施教，才能让孩子自信、有内驱力！</view>
          <view class="method-text">《慧眼读心赋能法》运用传统文化的核心智慧，让家长一听就懂、一学就会、一用就灵！</view>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="question-panel">
        <view class="question-copy">
          <view class="question-title">先观察三位小朋友</view>
          <view class="question-desc">首先，家长请观察图中三位小朋友，您认为您的孩子更像是哪种类型的孩子？</view>
        </view>
        <image class="question-image" src="{{heroImage}}" mode="aspectFit"></image>
        <view class="question-tip">没有标准答案，按你最了解孩子的感觉选即可。</view>
      </view>

      <view class="section-heading">
        <view class="section-title">选择一个最接近的答案</view>
        <view class="section-note">完成后会生成孩子的内心需求解读</view>
      </view>

      <view class="choice-grid">
        <choice-card
          wx:for="{{options}}"
          wx:key="type"
          option="{{item}}"
          selected="{{selectedType === item.type}}"
          bind:select="onSelect"
        ></choice-card>
      </view>

      <view class="bottom-spacer"></view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <sticky-action
    text="查看测评结果"
    disabled="{{!selectedType}}"
    bind:primary="onViewResult"
  ></sticky-action>
</view>
